event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_85f1a953a0bad5c9006a51b958bc0481909caad1c257acbcc2","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":275,"text":"**Smart Eyewear** (in the Contoso documentation) refers to **SmartView Glasses** from **Contoso Galaxy Innovations** . It’s eyewear that combines traditional lens protection with embedded electronics for AR, audio/video capture, and hands-free interaction.\n\n## Smart Eyewear features (SmartView Glasses)\n- **Augmented Reality (AR) interface:** Provides an AR experience directly through the glasses, enabling digital overlays and interactive visual elements .  \n- **Voice-controlled AI agent:** Lets you control functions and interact using voice commands for hands-free use .  \n- **HD video recording with 3D audio:** Captures high-definition video while recording spatial/3D audio for more immersive playback .  \n- **UV protection and blue light filtering:** Offers eye protection from UV exposure and reduces blue light impact for comfort during use .  \n- **Wireless charging + extended battery life:** Supports wireless charging and is designed for longer usage time between charges .  \n\n## What the documentation covers beyond the feature list\nThe SmartView Glasses user guide includes sections on **product overview (features and controls)**, **sizing and fit**, **care and maintenance**, an **AR break-in period**, **safety tips**, and **troubleshooting** ."}

